Action: grep
Action Input: {"pattern": "pe", "path": "bulk_relaxation.log", "ignore_case": true, "line_numbers": false}

Thought: The grep command did not return the potential energy values, likely because it only found the line where the thermo_style is set. I need to read the log file to find the final potential energy value after the minimization process. I will read the contents of the log file to locate this information.
Action: read_file
